{
  "bridge_text": "寒风吹动了莉娜的长发，她在那深邃的树洞前屏住呼吸，决定继续探寻那低吟的秘密。",
  "resume_strategy": "continue",
  "replacement_segments": [
    {
      "id": "s1",
      "text": "莉娜裹紧了红色的毛呢外套，在那巨大的树洞前停下了脚步。树干的纹理粗糙而冰冷，但那阵嗡嗡声却像是有生命的暖流，从深处缓缓涌出。她深吸一口气，拨开垂下的藤蔓，毅然迈步走进了那片黑暗之中。"
    }
  ],
  "active_scene_id": "s1"
}

{
  "bridge_text": "The secrets behind Mosk's frown remain hidden in the shadows, but his silence speaks volumes. Lina stands at the top of the stairs, waiting to see what he does next.",
  "resume_strategy": "continue",
  "replacement_segments": [
    {
      "id": "s2",
      "text": "Lina stood firm, her eyes meeting the fox’s stern gaze. She knew the tree held a mystery she had to solve, even if Mosk wished for her to leave. He watched her intently, his tail twitching against the wooden floorboards as he weighed whether to turn her away or let her pass deeper into the hollow."
    }
  ],
  "active_scene_id": "s2"
}

{
  "bridge_text": "With Mosk’s name tucked safely in our hearts, the old fox shifted his weight. He looked at the narrow entrance, clearly expecting Lina to turn back toward the sunlight.",
  "resume_strategy": "skip",
  "replacement_segments": [
    {
      "id": "s3",
      "text": "Mosk pointed firmly at the door, his eyes dark and serious. Lina didn't budge. Instead, she reached into her pocket and pulled out the last apple of the season, a bright splash of red against the grey wood. She set it on the step between them and whispered that it was a gift for the trouble of walking her down. Mosk stared at the apple for a long time, his expression softening until he finally stood up, adjusted his green vest, and stepped onto the first stair."
    },
    {
      "id": "s4",
      "text": "At the bottom of the stairs, the humming grew into a quiet, pulsing song. There, nestled on a bed of moss, lay a firefly the size of a robin, her golden glow flickering like a dying candle. Mosk’s whiskers trembled as he looked at her. He whispered that she had been his friend once, but one winter long ago, he had failed to bring her the medicine she needed. Ever since that cold season, he had guarded the tree in silence, too ashamed to face her again."
    }
  ],
  "active_scene_id": "s3"
}

{
  "bridge_text": "Even with her heart set on kindness, Lina knows that every step forward must be careful. As Mosk begins his descent, the air grows heavy with the secret he has been guarding.",
